# Genres: GLO held + the PRESETS dial switches the bank of ten pieces (sixteen banks) (the original, lofi, house, dubstep, dub, dnb, breaks, garage, electro, trap, disco, funk, reggae, synthwave, amapiano, trip-hop); the same piece
# number plays. A genre brings its effects (lofi: the vinyl and the tape latched; house: the pump). Only the first bank stores.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect genre 0
expect piece 0
expect tempo 128
expect fxlock 0
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET 1
wait 200
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
expect piece 0
expect tempo 72
expect fxlock 35651584
shot genre_lofi.png
# the pieces of the bank by the dial
turn PRESET 1
wait 200
expect piece 1
expect tempo 78
# a store works in every bank (piece 1 here: bit 1); undone, so the rest of this scenario sees the factory pieces
tap GLO
press SAVE
wait 200
release SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 2
expect dirty 0
# the next genre: house (the pump latched), then dubstep (nothing latched)
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 2
expect piece 1
expect tempo 124
expect fxlock 8388608
shot genre_house.png
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 3
expect piece 1
expect tempo 140
expect fxlock 0
shot genre_dub.png
# the six more (dub, dnb, breaks, garage, electro, trap): piece 1 of each, by its tempo
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 4
expect tempo 66
peakreset
wait 2500
expect peak_db_min -40
